{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.10f231d2b56a7eb0ae40af8c.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The selected control tests applicability of the announced exemption to one corporation, one option transaction and one assessment date.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.10f231d2b56a7eb0ae40af8c.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The explicit commencement date governs the announcement; the promised amendment and gazettal are not treated as unstated conditions precedent.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.10f231d2b56a7eb0ae40af8c.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Product and actor classifications are supplied facts requiring appropriate assessment, not inferred from a product label or the Code's title.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.10f231d2b56a7eb0ae40af8c.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Whether a later notice affects this transaction on the assessment date remains unknown unless supported by further evidence.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"526bcbb38febcb886696d4c92127d223af34aae528dd9157788ff65631179443","candidate_id":"candidate.749a37a7a745492fb45638c957606400","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For a licensed corporation and an otherwise applicable margin obligation within Part III of Schedule 10, true means the assessed transaction satisfies the proposed conditions for the announced SFC exemption: it is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, the assessment date is on or after 4 January 2026, and the announcement remains applicable on that date. False means at least one of those conditions fails; it does not establish that margin is owed under every other rule. Outside the stated scope this control supplies no applicability decision, and unknown facts remain unknown.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.68e579b3f4a243